# TypeScript incremental build info
*.tsbuildinfo

# `next dev` (Next 16.3+) writes these unless the app's next.config sets
# `agentRules: false`, which web, join and guide all do. They stay ignored as a
# backstop: an apps/web/AGENTS.md would SHADOW the repo-root AGENTS.md for
# anything working inside apps/web, and neither file is ours to keep.
apps/web/AGENTS.md
apps/web/CLAUDE.md
apps/join/AGENTS.md
apps/join/CLAUDE.md
